[00:00.00] 作词 : David Gilmour/Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : David Gilmour/Roger Waters
[00:09.37]Come on, my friends,
[00:09.37]来吧 我的朋友
[00:10.93]Let's make for the hills.
[00:10.93]让我们征服群山
[00:13.01]They say there's gold but I'm looking for thrills.
[00:13.01]他们说上面有金子 但我只为了寻求刺激
[00:17.25]You can get your hands on whatever we find,
[00:17.25]你能分享我们找到的任何东西
[00:21.25]Because I'm only coming along for the ride.
[00:21.25]因为我只为了路上纯粹的旅行
[00:25.27]Well, you go your way,
[00:25.27]好吧 你走你的路
[00:28.01]I'll go mine.
[00:28.01]我走我的
[00:30.03]I don't care if we get there on time.
[00:30.03]我不在乎我们是否能准点抵达
[00:34.07]Everybody's searching for something, they say.
[00:34.07]每个人一生都在寻找什么 他们如是说
[00:38.21]I'll get my kicks on the way.
[00:38.21]我将一直在路上
[00:42.24]Over the mountains, across the seas
[00:42.24]翻山越岭 穿越重洋
[00:43.43]
[00:46.35]Who knows what will be waiting for me?
[00:46.35]天知道有什么在等着我呢
[00:50.00]I could sail forever to strange sounding names.
[00:50.00]我一生都在寻找耸人听闻的名号
[00:54.34]Faces of people and places don't change.
[00:54.34]人们的面孔和居住地毫无变化
[00:58.40]All I have to do is just close my eyes
[00:58.40]我只需闭上我的双眼
[01:02.49]To see the seagulls wheeling on those far distant skies.
[01:02.49]就能看见海鸥在遥远的上空盘旋
[01:06.55]All I want to tell you, all I want to say
[01:06.55]我想告诉你的话 我只想说
[01:10.28]Is count me in on the journey.
[01:10.28]让我加入你们的旅途吧
[01:12.14]Don't expect me to stay.
[01:12.14]别让我一个人留下
